    "media:imagetext": "FORTY\nNINERS\n1255 POST STREET\nSUITE 300\nSAN FRANCISCO, CALIFORNIA 94109\n(415) 771-1149\nMay 15, 1972\nI am pleased to inform you that you have been chosen as an\nalternate member of the 19/2 Niner Nuggets.\nYou were one of\nnearly 100 girls who applied for this year's group. We were\nboth surprised and pleased at the interest shown.\nAs an alternate, you are among those girls whom we will\ncall upon, if and when, openings occur in the group throughout\nthe season.\nOn behalf of all of the judges and the San Francisco 49ers,\nI want to thank you for the time you took in applying and inter-\nviewing with the 4gers. It was a pleasure meeting you!\nSincerely,\nDick Beng\nDick Berg\nDirector of Promotions\nDB : rm\n1970 NFC WESTERN DIVISION CHAMPIONS",
